---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Homi Software Ecosystem" description="Practical software for everyday business.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">One ecosystem. Connected tools.</span><h1>Practical technology<br />for more organized work.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Homi is a growing software ecosystem designed to help businesses manage everyday operations with clear workflows and careful data handling.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/en/apps/">Explore apps →</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/en/activation/">Activation and subscriptions</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit"><div class="orbit-core">H</div></div><div class="float-card one">Practical tools</div><div class="float-card two">Your data stays in your control</div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">The Homi approach</span><h2>Software shaped around your work.</h2><p>We build focused applications with straightforward interfaces, dependable workflows, and attention to data integrity.</p></div>
    <div class="cards"><article class="card"><div class="card-icon">◈</div><h3>Clarity</h3><p>Organized interfaces make everyday information and actions easier to reach.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="card-icon">⌁</div><h3>Independence</h3><p>Applications are designed for real operating needs, including local-first workflows where appropriate.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="card-icon">◇</div><h3>Built to grow</h3><p>A modular ecosystem that can add products while keeping data and permissions separated.</p></article></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="band"><div class="container band-inner"><div><h2>Find the right tool for your business.</h2><p>Explore Homi Grocery and learn about activation and support.</p></div><a class="button" href="/en/apps/">Explore Homi apps</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
